/.idea/
/precheck_results/
*/tmp
*/*/tmp
*.hex*
# Exception: boot.hex and boot_rom.hex are contest firmware deliverables
# (built from fw/main.c via riscv64-unknown-elf-gcc; boot.hex is the
# byte-addressed Verilog hex emitted by `objcopy -O verilog`; boot_rom.hex
# is the flat 32-bit word array form for $readmemh into a local boot ROM
# array such as rv_core_ibex_tlul.boot_rom). Both are built by the
# default `make -C fw` target and are loaded by simulation, FPGA bring-up,
# and the hardened ASIC ROM initialization.
!boot.hex
!boot_rom.hex
*.lst
*.vcd
*.gtkw
